      <section class="proof-path" aria-labelledby="proof-path-title">
        <div class="proof-path__header">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">Intent → proof</p><h2 id="proof-path-title">Where proof stops</h2></div>
          <p>Counts are sequential. Each drop is the earliest unmet gate, so a strict score never looks like a broken report. Select a gate to inspect those requirements.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="proof-rail" aria-label="Filter requirements by earliest unmet proof gate"><li>
    <button type="button" class="proof-gate proof-gate--blocked" data-gate="semantic" data-label="Semantic model" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="requirements" aria-label="Semantic model. No requirement stops here." disabled>
      <div class="proof-gate__node"><span>1</span></div>
      <div class="proof-gate__count">0</div>
      <div class="proof-gate__label">Semantic model</div>
      <div class="proof-gate__drop">No drop</div>
      <p>Intent is complete, grounded, and coherent</p>
    </button>
  </li><li>
    <button type="button" class="proof-gate proof-gate--blocked" data-gate="scenario" data-label="Scenario" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="requirements" aria-label="Scenario. No requirement stops here." disabled>
      <div class="proof-gate__node"><span>2</span></div>
      <div class="proof-gate__count">0</div>
      <div class="proof-gate__label">Scenario</div>
      <div class="proof-gate__drop">No drop</div>
